%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4fafe43b89343e3a7ba1235e8987c0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 5.5. jackieIvesDiscussionV2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: Thought I'd find you here.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1207052918024306759
    - rid: 1207052918024306770
    - rid: 1207052918024306771
    - rid: 1207052918024306772
  - content: Ives!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1207052918024306760
    - rid: 1207053248668106817
    - rid: 1207053248668106818
    - rid: 1207053248668106816
  - content: "Mornin\u2019 Jackie. I trust that you have everything prepared? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1207052918024306761
  - content: "Just a heads up, I\u2019ll be one of the examiners joining the expedition."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "You\u2019ll be coming with us? You better be watching when I pass this
      exam with flying colors."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Hah, don\u2019t worry, I won\u2019t be the only one watching you leave
      everyone in the dust."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1207053248668106820
  - content: 'Just remember that the exam is going to simulate a real NITES expedition
      into the Wasteland. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1207053248668106821
  - content: 'There have been casualties before. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1207053248668106822
  - content: "Yes, I know. I\u2019m ready."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1207052918024306763
  - content: Though, let's go over the fundamentals again.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1207052918024306764
  - content: As a warm up.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1207052918024306765
  - content: 'Haha, sure kid. There''s always room to improve the fundamentals. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1207053248668106823
  - content: Just make sure not to overexert yourself.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Come help me set up this dummy then, would you?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1207052918024306767
    - rid: 1207052918024306768
